          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiramu Omukama Tiro kayahuliire okwo Solomoni bamukozire amajuta akaba Mukama akasikira ishe, kuba Hiramu ogwo yagonzaga Daudi, amutumaho ababakabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma Solomoni atuma ahali Hiramu ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nomanya okwo tata Daudi atashoboire kwombekera Mukama Ruhangawe Rwensinga aha rw'enshonga y'endashana ezabaire zimuzingoire kuhika orwo Omukama Ruhanga yamunagire ababishabe abo omu mikono akabasinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai mbwenu Omukama Ruhanga wange antungire emilembe buli rubaju. Taliyo babisha anga biyengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo nindenga kwombekera Omukama Ruhanga wange Rwensinga nk'okwo Omukama yahangiire tata Daudi, ati, ‘Omwana wawe owo nditeka aha nketo yawe akakusikira n'iwe alinyombekera Rwensinga.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpaho oragire bantemere emyelezi ya Lebanoni. Abairu bange barakora n'abawe, kandi abairu bawe ndabahera aha mpera ey'orataho, enshonga nomanya okwo omu bantu bange ntainamu balikumanya kushara mbaho nk'Abasidoni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiramu kayahuliire ebigambo bya Solomoni ashemelerwa muno; agamba ati, “Kir'eki Omukama asingizibwe, ayahaire Daudi omwana aina obumanyi kutwara eihanga lihango eli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atuma ahali Solomoni ati, “Amakuru ago ag'ontumireho ngahuliire, ninyikiliza kukora byona nk'okw'olikwetaga, kutema emielezi n'emivure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abairu bange baragihya Lebanoni bagisongore aha nyanja. Ndagikomejanyia, ngyeleze aha nyanja egobe mbali oragamba. Aho niho ndagikomorolera naiwe okagitora. Inye ekyo ndikwenda iwe orampa ebyakulya by'okuliisa abange.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Hiramu aha Solomoni emiti y'emielezi n'emivure nk'okwo yabaire nayetaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni ogwo aha Hiramu engano amapipa 20,000 g'okulisa aba wenene n'amapipa 20 g'amajuta agarungi muno. Yamushashuraga atyo buli mwaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama atunga Solomoni obumanyi nk'okwo yamuraganisize. Hiramu na Solomoni bagira emilembe. Bombili bakora hamoi endagano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Solomoni akajaraba abantu ab'okuta nibaihyana omuli Isiraeli yona. Abajarabirwe abo bakaba bali bantu 30,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli mwezi yatwekaga Lebanoni abantu 10,000 kwihyangana n'abandi. Omwezi gumoi bagumaraga Lebanoni, n'emyezi ebili bagimaraga owabo. Omunyampara w'abajarabwa akaba ali Adoniramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni akaba aina abagata enkumi nshanju n'ababaizi b'amabaare omu mabanga 80,000, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "otakabazire banyamparabe 3,300 abalebeleraga abajarabwa abo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk'okwo Omukama yaragiire bakashokora amabare gahango agalengize ag'eiguzi kwombekesa ekitebe kya Rwensinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo abombeki ba Solomoni n'aba Hiramu n'abarugire Gebali, bakabaija amabare, batekateka n'emiti kwombeka Rwensinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
